                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-certificate text-teal-400"></i> Major: <span class="text-slate-100 font-bold">Artificial Intelligence – Going into 3rd Year</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Curriculum focused on software engineering principles, algorithms, machine learning foundational models, relational databases, and cyber security principles.
