                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-slate-100">Soft Skills</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-300 text-sm">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-amber-400 text-xs"></i> Communication</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-amber-400 text-xs"></i> Teamwork</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-amber-400 text-xs"></i> Willingness to Learn</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-amber-400 text-xs"></i> Analytical Thinking</li>
