                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Let's <span class="text-teal-400">Connect</span></h2>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-amber-500 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
                <!-- Info Column -->
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">Get in Touch</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-base leading-relaxed">
                        I am open to discussions regarding AI, Data Science opportunities, and tech collaborations. Reach out to me directly!
                    </p>

                    <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
