                        </a>

                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/safaa-salaheldin-051893376/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 glass-card rounded-xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
